1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 38=

4
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:41,300
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)
I'm not going.

5
00:01:41,980 --> 00:01:43,380
I've spent 50 years

6
00:01:43,620 --> 00:01:46,420
drowning in endless schemes.

7
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:48,940
I've lost my beloved wife,

8
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,740
and now my children too.

9
00:01:57,060 --> 00:01:58,060
I truly am alone

10
00:01:59,220 --> 00:02:01,060
in this world.

11
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:03,580
Your Majesty.

12
00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:06,340
As long as there's
still breath in you...

13
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,620
Say no more.

14
00:02:10,220 --> 00:02:12,500
I'm not going anywhere.

15
00:02:13,220 --> 00:02:14,780
Fleeing south,
seeking refuge in the west.

16
00:02:14,940 --> 00:02:16,460
Wandering from place to place.

17
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:20,140
I can't endure it anymore.

18
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:23,540
I am the Son of Heaven.

19
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:27,220
I can't die on the flight.

20
00:02:28,860 --> 00:02:30,100
I'll stay right here

21
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,660
and let the people of Sheng'an know

22
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:36,020
that at least

23
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,860
I didn't abandon them.

24
00:02:47,340 --> 00:02:48,140
Jiyuan.

25
00:02:51,460 --> 00:02:53,820
Remember when we were young?

26
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,460
We had such grand ambitions.

27
00:03:06,100 --> 00:03:07,980
Now they're all gone.

28
00:03:11,540 --> 00:03:12,540
Go on.

29
00:03:15,220 --> 00:03:17,620
Huai still needs you.

30
00:03:21,140 --> 00:03:24,740
Your Majesty, we're both old men now.

31
00:03:26,820 --> 00:03:27,980
This parting

32
00:03:30,220 --> 00:03:32,100
shall be our last.

33
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:06,180
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

34
00:04:25,540 --> 00:04:26,900
Go load the things onto the carts.

35
00:04:27,500 --> 00:04:28,220
Be careful.

36
00:04:28,460 --> 00:04:28,780
Yes, sir.

37
00:04:50,260 --> 00:04:50,860
Safe travels.

38
00:04:56,660 --> 00:04:57,100
Yan Shang.

39
00:04:58,660 --> 00:04:59,380
Do you realize

40
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:01,540
that even if you stay,

41
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:03,540
they won't be grateful to you?

42
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:05,180
They'll only

43
00:05:06,340 --> 00:05:07,060
resent you.

44
00:05:11,620 --> 00:05:12,620
Because your presence

45
00:05:14,180 --> 00:05:16,700
only throws their cowardice and baseness

46
00:05:17,300 --> 00:05:17,860
into sharper relief!

47
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:22,340
What about you?

48
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:26,180
Do you resent me too?

49
00:05:33,660 --> 00:05:34,140
Yan Shang.

50
00:05:36,260 --> 00:05:38,980
You're just as annoying as you were
back in school.

51
00:05:42,580 --> 00:05:43,500
But back then,

52
00:05:44,900 --> 00:05:45,740
you always helped me.

53
00:05:46,340 --> 00:05:47,060
That's not a contradiction.

54
00:05:49,580 --> 00:05:50,620
I saw you as a friend,

55
00:05:51,740 --> 00:05:53,220
yet I couldn't help but resent you.

56
00:05:58,420 --> 00:05:58,660
No.

57
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:02,980
Perhaps I was just...

58
00:06:06,460 --> 00:06:07,260
jealous.

59
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:13,180
Because I knew better than anyone

60
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:16,740
how clever

61
00:06:18,620 --> 00:06:19,740
and gifted you were.

62
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:21,820
You seem to see through everything.

63
00:06:32,180 --> 00:06:34,220
You listened to all my arrogant nonsense

64
00:06:35,380 --> 00:06:37,620
and watched me daydream
about the future.

65
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:44,100
Yet you never once called me out.

66
00:06:48,100 --> 00:06:49,220
Because I envied you.

67
00:06:50,980 --> 00:06:51,860
Your privilege.

68
00:06:52,740 --> 00:06:53,340
Your composure.

69
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:54,580
Your righteousness.

70
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:56,420
Your high spirits.

71
00:06:57,580 --> 00:06:59,060
I'd never known any of them.

72
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:05,740
And I'd never had

73
00:07:08,420 --> 00:07:09,980
a friend like you.

74
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:24,300
What about now?

75
00:07:27,860 --> 00:07:28,860
Do you still see me as a friend?

76
00:07:49,860 --> 00:07:50,180
Yan Shang.

77
00:07:52,180 --> 00:07:52,540
Take care.

78
00:08:08,140 --> 00:08:08,900
We'll meet again.

79
00:08:38,540 --> 00:08:39,820
Stay safe.

80
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:44,980
Stay safe.

81
00:08:48,380 --> 00:08:49,460
Be safe.

82
00:08:50,700 --> 00:08:53,660
Stay safe.

83
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:56,340
Stay safe.

84
00:09:03,700 --> 00:09:08,580
(Guanghua Gate)

85
00:09:13,300 --> 00:09:13,980
How is it?

86
00:09:17,460 --> 00:09:17,900
Sir.

87
00:09:23,300 --> 00:09:24,220
Before the fighting begins,

88
00:09:24,740 --> 00:09:26,180
I'll have the city gates opened briefly.

89
00:09:26,740 --> 00:09:27,420
Anyone who wishes to leave,

90
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:28,460
civilian or official,

91
00:09:28,820 --> 00:09:29,540
may do so at once.

92
00:09:30,420 --> 00:09:32,060
I'll also station a cavalry unit
inside the city

93
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:34,140
in case the rebels launch
a surprise attack.

94
00:09:35,740 --> 00:09:36,540
Don't worry.

95
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:39,140
Mu Xun is unscrupulous

96
00:09:40,020 --> 00:09:41,380
and suspicious by nature.

97
00:09:41,620 --> 00:09:43,140
He won't dare attack

98
00:09:43,780 --> 00:09:45,500
until he knows what's going on.

99
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:47,100
But he'll certainly

100
00:09:47,620 --> 00:09:49,220
post men at the gates.

101
00:09:50,980 --> 00:09:52,100
He'll soon know

102
00:09:52,420 --> 00:09:53,820
when the imperial carriage leaves
the city.

103
00:09:57,340 --> 00:09:58,980
Whether we make it out

104
00:10:00,100 --> 00:10:01,740
will be up to fate.

105
00:10:07,020 --> 00:10:09,100
What do you think

106
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:10,300
of Mu Xun's troops?

107
00:10:14,580 --> 00:10:16,140
Huai has yet to recover its strength.

108
00:10:16,780 --> 00:10:18,380
The regional governors are sitting
on the sidelines,

109
00:10:18,780 --> 00:10:20,180
while foreign powers eye us hungrily.

110
00:10:21,380 --> 00:10:23,020
The armies of Handong and Hanbei

111
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:24,780
are among Huai's finest.

112
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:27,100
It'd be a terrible waste

113
00:10:27,700 --> 00:10:28,420
to lose them all at Sheng'an.

114
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:30,900
If possible,

115
00:10:31,660 --> 00:10:33,380
I'd rather keep them at a standoff

116
00:10:34,580 --> 00:10:35,900
and wait for a chance to win.

117
00:10:36,700 --> 00:10:38,260
Better than a direct clash
that leaves both sides

118
00:10:38,660 --> 00:10:39,380
with casualties.

119
00:10:40,540 --> 00:10:41,300
Good.

120
00:10:41,940 --> 00:10:43,260
That you can see this far

121
00:10:43,860 --> 00:10:45,020
shows you understand

122
00:10:45,460 --> 00:10:47,740
not only victory and defeat,
but the fate of the realm.

123
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:50,940
I'm relieved.

124
00:10:57,540 --> 00:10:58,300
Yan Shang.

125
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:02,700
I made you Commandant of the Guards
to defend this besieged city.

126
00:11:03,340 --> 00:11:04,020
Do you resent me?

127
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:05,980
If I were afraid,

128
00:11:07,260 --> 00:11:08,660
I wouldn't have rushed back
from Lanyang.

129
00:11:14,900 --> 00:11:15,340
Sir,

130
00:11:16,620 --> 00:11:17,580
head to Jinzhou first

131
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:19,020
and wait for things to turn.

132
00:11:23,820 --> 00:11:25,180
(Guanghua Gate)

133
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:27,500
Keep up!

134
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:29,940
(Guanghua Gate)
Hurry up.

135
00:11:30,700 --> 00:11:32,260
Don't stop!

136
00:11:33,700 --> 00:11:34,140
Hurry!

137
00:11:37,540 --> 00:11:38,340
Sir, today,

138
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:39,500
you and I

139
00:11:40,020 --> 00:11:40,980
each stake our lives.

140
00:11:42,140 --> 00:11:43,500
How could I resent you?

141
00:11:44,700 --> 00:11:45,660
Each

142
00:11:46,220 --> 00:11:47,180
stake our lives.

143
00:11:49,260 --> 00:11:50,100
Well said.

144
00:11:55,100 --> 00:11:56,300
Stay alive.

145
00:12:00,020 --> 00:12:02,060
You played that game of Go well.

146
00:12:02,740 --> 00:12:03,700
Keep playing.

147
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:06,820
You will win!

148
00:12:21,540 --> 00:12:22,300
By imperial command!

149
00:12:22,780 --> 00:12:23,620
We march today!

150
00:12:24,700 --> 00:12:25,500
All troops, hear my orders!

151
00:12:26,420 --> 00:12:27,380
Keep strict discipline!

152
00:12:27,940 --> 00:12:28,820
(Peace Throughout the Realm)
Fight bravely!

153
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:53,940
Chancellor Liu.

154
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:10,200
(Virtue Shines to Transform)

155
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:15,340
Yes!

156
00:13:17,580 --> 00:13:18,340
Report!

157
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:20,740
The city gates just opened.

158
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:22,460
Many officials and soldiers poured out.

159
00:13:22,780 --> 00:13:23,580
Then they shut again.

160
00:13:24,380 --> 00:13:25,180
The city is already in disarray

161
00:13:25,460 --> 00:13:26,540
before the fighting has even begun.

162
00:13:27,100 --> 00:13:28,220
I bet most of those who fled overnight

163
00:13:28,540 --> 00:13:29,740
were city officials.

164
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:30,700
Yes.

165
00:13:31,140 --> 00:13:32,420
Many officials left in their carriages.

166
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:33,820
Mu Ti is a spineless fool.

167
00:13:34,420 --> 00:13:35,740
He's a lost cause.

168
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:38,020
If he gets a chance to run,

169
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:39,900
he won't hesitate.

170
00:13:40,580 --> 00:13:41,540
Your Royal Highness, you think

171
00:13:42,340 --> 00:13:43,700
the Prince of Jin may be among them?

172
00:13:44,140 --> 00:13:45,340
Probably not just my brother.

173
00:13:46,420 --> 00:13:47,380
Even my father

174
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:49,940
will try to escape while he can.

175
00:13:50,300 --> 00:13:50,980
Go cut them off.

176
00:13:51,380 --> 00:13:51,620
Yes!

177
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:52,580
Report!

178
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:56,260
Several large carriages headed east,

179
00:13:56,420 --> 00:13:57,860
followed by a few mounted guards.

180
00:13:57,940 --> 00:13:59,420
Another large carriage headed west,

181
00:13:59,660 --> 00:14:00,660
accompanied by the imperial procession.

182
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:02,820
I'll split our forces
and intercept them all.

183
00:14:03,340 --> 00:14:03,620
Wait.

184
00:14:05,140 --> 00:14:05,820
Is Chancellor Liu

185
00:14:06,540 --> 00:14:07,180
among them?

186
00:14:08,100 --> 00:14:09,260
He headed north
with one of the carriages.

187
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:10,340
Wang Chengding.

188
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:12,380
Take the main force yourself.

189
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:14,940
You must stop the carriage
Chancellor Liu is with.

190
00:14:15,300 --> 00:14:16,620
If I'm right,

191
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:19,580
my brother and father

192
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,260
should be in it.

193
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:23,700
Your Royal Highness,

194
00:14:25,260 --> 00:14:26,460
I'll bring them back.

195
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:33,820
Take them away!

196
00:14:35,060 --> 00:14:35,620
Take them!

197
00:14:35,780 --> 00:14:36,220
Get out!

198
00:14:36,500 --> 00:14:36,980
Everyone out!

199
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:37,300
Don't move!

200
00:14:37,380 --> 00:14:37,700
Hurry!

201
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:38,180
Don't run!

202
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:04,660
Chancellor Liu.

203
00:15:28,620 --> 00:15:29,380
Where's Mu Ti?

204
00:15:30,860 --> 00:15:31,620
And where

205
00:15:32,500 --> 00:15:33,660
have you hidden my father?

206
00:15:43,220 --> 00:15:45,820
All of you were
once loyal, brave generals.

207
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:47,940
Now you bow to traitors

208
00:15:48,460 --> 00:15:49,860
and march on the imperial palace.

209
00:15:50,540 --> 00:15:53,060
Aren't you afraid of being condemned
for this for generations to come?

210
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:00,220
I am

211
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:02,180
Huai's rightful heir.

212
00:16:02,820 --> 00:16:04,900
My rule in Sheng'an
is the will of Heaven.

213
00:16:05,220 --> 00:16:06,060
The will of Heaven?

214
00:16:08,940 --> 00:16:10,420
You've stirred up war,

215
00:16:10,620 --> 00:16:13,780
setting beacon fires blazing,
and throwing the realm into unrest.

216
00:16:14,420 --> 00:16:16,460
For the land and the people,

217
00:16:17,100 --> 00:16:19,500
do you even show a trace
of a true ruler?

218
00:16:38,700 --> 00:16:39,180
Your Royal Highness.

219
00:16:39,700 --> 00:16:40,860
Chancellor Liu is a pillar of the state.

220
00:16:41,140 --> 00:16:42,020
Please spare his life.

221
00:17:04,140 --> 00:17:04,980
Soldiers!

222
00:17:06,860 --> 00:17:08,340
Hanbei and Handong

223
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:10,660
both suffered severe drought this year.

224
00:17:11,620 --> 00:17:12,300
The court

225
00:17:12,940 --> 00:17:14,700
ordered granaries opened

226
00:17:15,180 --> 00:17:17,300
to relieve your hometowns.

227
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:18,380
Yet you

228
00:17:19,180 --> 00:17:20,580
follow traitors.

229
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:23,620
Who'll care for the starving back home?

230
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:25,820
You

231
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:27,980
are all soldiers of Huai.

232
00:17:28,980 --> 00:17:30,460
Your families have enjoyed
the state's grace.

233
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:32,420
By Huai law,

234
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:33,460
rebellion

235
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:36,620
and treason are punishable by death!

236
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:40,820
By following traitors,

237
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:43,940
you betray your sovereign
and fail your people!

238
00:18:06,020 --> 00:18:08,020
Back then, Yan Changshan

239
00:18:08,580 --> 00:18:11,260
kept cursing the rebels
even after his tongue was cut out.

240
00:18:15,220 --> 00:18:16,020
Now,

241
00:18:16,620 --> 00:18:18,180
I'll follow his example.

242
00:18:19,180 --> 00:18:20,220
What joy.

243
00:18:20,940 --> 00:18:22,460
What joy!

244
00:18:47,540 --> 00:18:48,580
You old pedant.

245
00:19:00,420 --> 00:19:01,420
Thank goodness.

246
00:19:01,780 --> 00:19:02,340
I

247
00:19:03,020 --> 00:19:04,060
really am blessed.

248
00:19:04,700 --> 00:19:05,540
Heaven won't let me die yet.

249
00:19:24,020 --> 00:19:24,660
Commandant of the Guards.

250
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:26,220
Chancellor Liu was intercepted
by the rebels.

251
00:19:26,780 --> 00:19:27,380
He was killed.

252
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:45,140
(You're out here admiring)

253
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:49,340
(the scenery so early in the morning.)

254
00:19:50,860 --> 00:19:51,860
(What fine spirits.)

255
00:19:54,980 --> 00:19:56,660
(Then do you dare stay)

256
00:19:57,340 --> 00:20:00,740
(and settle the injustices
of this realm?)

257
00:20:06,900 --> 00:20:08,980
(You played that game of Go well.)

258
00:20:09,660 --> 00:20:10,620
(Keep playing.)

259
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:13,660
(You will win!)

260
00:20:17,020 --> 00:20:17,580
Chancellor Liu.

261
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:20,860
I'll stay.

262
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:23,780
I'll hold the line.

263
00:20:28,620 --> 00:20:29,020
Pass the order.

264
00:20:30,300 --> 00:20:31,660
Summon the Left and Right
Jinwu Guard Generals,

265
00:20:31,980 --> 00:20:33,500
the Left and Right
Shence Army Commandants,

266
00:20:33,820 --> 00:20:35,340
and the Zhechong Commandants
of the capital garrisons

267
00:20:36,140 --> 00:20:36,860
to discuss our defense.

268
00:20:37,500 --> 00:20:37,900
Yes!

269
00:20:38,900 --> 00:20:41,100
We have enough provisions
in the city for a month.

270
00:20:41,820 --> 00:20:42,540
Crossbow bolt supplies

271
00:20:43,380 --> 00:20:44,260
are limited to 300 a day.

272
00:20:44,780 --> 00:20:45,420
Starting today,

273
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:47,820
the troops on the walls stand watch
in shifts, day and night.

274
00:20:48,460 --> 00:20:49,820
Report all military developments to me.

275
00:20:51,060 --> 00:20:52,060
I'll hold the line right here.

276
00:20:56,100 --> 00:20:58,460
Both rebel armies have marched
a long way to attack us.

277
00:20:59,020 --> 00:20:59,820
Their supplies must be running low.

278
00:21:01,020 --> 00:21:01,980
We must hold them off.

279
00:21:02,980 --> 00:21:03,580
Yes!

280
00:21:04,100 --> 00:21:04,820
We've reached Sheng'an.

281
00:21:05,220 --> 00:21:06,660
We have to strike fast to win.

282
00:21:08,060 --> 00:21:08,660
Stock up on provisions.

283
00:21:09,180 --> 00:21:09,900
We must take the city

284
00:21:10,340 --> 00:21:11,140
within three days,

285
00:21:12,140 --> 00:21:12,940
five at most.

286
00:21:13,220 --> 00:21:13,620
Your Royal Highness.

287
00:21:14,900 --> 00:21:16,660
Sheng'an's walls are said
to be impregnable.

288
00:21:17,060 --> 00:21:18,660
A direct assault may not work.

289
00:21:21,980 --> 00:21:23,980
(Sheng'an)

290
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:27,180
Then think of something else.

291
00:21:28,140 --> 00:21:32,860
(Sheng'an)

292
00:21:32,860 --> 00:21:39,500
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

293
00:21:49,060 --> 00:21:51,180
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

294
00:21:54,060 --> 00:21:59,540
(Virtue Shines to Transform)

295
00:22:06,820 --> 00:22:09,780
(Virtue Shines to Transform)

296
00:22:20,940 --> 00:22:21,380
Wenji.

297
00:22:22,060 --> 00:22:22,740
Are we there yet?

298
00:22:43,420 --> 00:22:47,620
Your Majesty, welcome to Jinzhou!

299
00:22:47,780 --> 00:22:51,060
Long live Your Majesty!

300
00:22:54,660 --> 00:22:56,820
(Residence of the Prefect of Jinzhou)

301
00:22:56,820 --> 00:22:58,220
Come on, fill it up.

302
00:23:03,740 --> 00:23:04,420
Mr. Liu, please.

303
00:23:05,140 --> 00:23:06,100
Please.

304
00:23:07,460 --> 00:23:08,500
Come on, drink up.

305
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:10,220
You hold your liquor well, sir.

306
00:23:11,580 --> 00:23:12,420
Very good.

307
00:23:13,540 --> 00:23:14,100
Fill it up.

308
00:23:15,620 --> 00:23:16,700
Come on.

309
00:23:17,540 --> 00:23:18,180
Fill it up.

310
00:23:25,380 --> 00:23:25,860
Fang Tong.

311
00:23:26,860 --> 00:23:27,620
It's been three years.

312
00:23:27,980 --> 00:23:28,820
Commander Yan, how have you been?

313
00:23:29,260 --> 00:23:29,940
It's been a long time.

314
00:23:37,420 --> 00:23:38,580
Why are so many people gathered
down there?

315
00:23:41,140 --> 00:23:42,020
(Guanghua Gate)

316
00:23:42,020 --> 00:23:42,500
Report!

317
00:23:44,420 --> 00:23:44,980
What's happening?

318
00:23:45,340 --> 00:23:46,740
The rebels have looted every farm

319
00:23:46,900 --> 00:23:48,220
and field around Sheng'an.

320
00:23:48,780 --> 00:23:49,820
Stored grain seized as military rations.

321
00:23:50,140 --> 00:23:51,140
Green wheat cut for horse feed.

322
00:23:51,780 --> 00:23:52,540
The people are terrified

323
00:23:53,260 --> 00:23:54,300
and want to take refuge in the city,

324
00:23:54,380 --> 00:23:54,740
so...

325
00:23:55,580 --> 00:23:57,060
So they've gathered outside the gates.

326
00:23:59,980 --> 00:24:00,460
What's wrong?

327
00:24:01,380 --> 00:24:02,340
My home

328
00:24:03,180 --> 00:24:04,060
is just outside the city.

329
00:24:09,900 --> 00:24:11,100
Open the gates!

330
00:24:24,260 --> 00:24:25,700
(Guanghua Gate)

331
00:24:27,500 --> 00:24:28,100
(Guanghua Gate)
Are they insane?

332
00:24:28,740 --> 00:24:29,620
They're killing innocent civilians

333
00:24:30,060 --> 00:24:31,140
just to force us to open the gates!

334
00:24:31,740 --> 00:24:32,340
If we open them,

335
00:24:33,300 --> 00:24:34,620
they'll storm the city.

336
00:24:35,860 --> 00:24:36,340
If we don't,

337
00:24:37,260 --> 00:24:38,860
we'll lose the people's trust.

338
00:24:44,260 --> 00:24:45,380
(Guanghua Gate)

339
00:24:47,820 --> 00:24:49,260
(Guanghua Gate)

340
00:25:30,180 --> 00:25:33,940
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

341
00:25:44,100 --> 00:25:45,780
(Guanghua Gate)

342
00:25:48,180 --> 00:25:48,700
Report!

343
00:25:50,500 --> 00:25:50,940
What is it?

344
00:25:51,540 --> 00:25:54,100
The commander defending the city sent
Shence Army elites out to fight.

345
00:25:56,100 --> 00:25:57,540
Sending cavalry to rescue civilians?

346
00:25:58,500 --> 00:25:59,500
Quite a sacrifice.

347
00:26:01,140 --> 00:26:02,980
Who's holding Sheng'an now?

348
00:26:03,260 --> 00:26:04,620
I hear it's a county magistrate.

349
00:26:04,820 --> 00:26:05,580
A magistrate?

350
00:26:06,940 --> 00:26:07,660
Which one?

351
00:26:10,340 --> 00:26:11,060
It's Yan Shang.

352
00:26:20,620 --> 00:26:21,100
Tan Yuanchun.

353
00:26:21,700 --> 00:26:21,980
Here.

354
00:26:22,540 --> 00:26:23,140
Move out!

355
00:26:23,460 --> 00:26:23,740
Yes!

356
00:26:51,660 --> 00:26:52,300
Attack!

357
00:26:55,620 --> 00:26:56,260
(Guanghua Gate)

358
00:26:58,260 --> 00:26:59,300
(Peace Throughout the Realm)

359
00:27:07,420 --> 00:27:08,180
Run!

360
00:27:09,820 --> 00:27:11,460
Run! Hurry!

361
00:27:36,780 --> 00:27:37,380
Hang in there!

362
00:27:39,780 --> 00:27:40,380
Bear with it.

363
00:27:45,140 --> 00:27:46,540
Our harvest...

364
00:27:46,980 --> 00:27:48,100
The wheat would've been golden

365
00:27:48,380 --> 00:27:49,340
in just half a month.

366
00:27:49,340 --> 00:27:50,460
How are we supposed to survive?

367
00:27:50,580 --> 00:27:52,420
What are we going to do?

368
00:28:26,900 --> 00:28:27,700
Thank you.

369
00:28:27,980 --> 00:28:29,060
Thank you so much.

370
00:28:36,620 --> 00:28:39,940
(Guanghua Gate)

371
00:28:51,780 --> 00:28:53,420
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

372
00:28:53,900 --> 00:28:55,740
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

373
00:28:56,220 --> 00:28:57,740
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

374
00:28:58,020 --> 00:29:00,580
It's the deposed Crown Prince!

375
00:29:24,380 --> 00:29:26,020
Several blocks of homes in Sheng'an
have burned down.

376
00:29:26,380 --> 00:29:28,060
The whole city is in a panic.

377
00:29:28,500 --> 00:29:29,340
The people are terrified of war.

378
00:29:29,940 --> 00:29:31,700
That's exactly what we want. Panic.

379
00:29:32,740 --> 00:29:34,100
To break the enemy without fighting.

380
00:29:34,740 --> 00:29:35,700
I'll take Sheng'an

381
00:29:36,500 --> 00:29:37,740
without shedding a drop of blood.

382
00:29:39,740 --> 00:29:40,220
Your Royal Highness.

383
00:29:41,420 --> 00:29:42,420
Even if we must take the city,

384
00:29:42,700 --> 00:29:43,380
these tactics

385
00:29:44,420 --> 00:29:46,140
are too cruel.

386
00:29:46,940 --> 00:29:48,020
Winner takes all.

387
00:29:48,380 --> 00:29:49,460
If the city falls, I live.

388
00:29:51,460 --> 00:29:52,700
If the army's defeated, I die.

389
00:29:56,420 --> 00:29:56,980
Yang Si.

390
00:29:58,340 --> 00:29:59,180
They're only defending

391
00:29:59,620 --> 00:30:00,420
the city, never attacking.

392
00:30:01,300 --> 00:30:02,460
What do you think they're waiting for?

393
00:30:04,380 --> 00:30:05,420
Reinforcements!

394
00:30:14,100 --> 00:30:14,980
I'll lead the attack myself

395
00:30:17,180 --> 00:30:18,140
tomorrow morning.

396
00:30:30,180 --> 00:30:31,100
No unauthorized visitors allowed!

397
00:30:31,140 --> 00:30:31,980
I need to see Commander Yan.

398
00:30:34,140 --> 00:30:34,620
Wei Shu?

399
00:30:36,060 --> 00:30:36,500
Yan Shang.

400
00:30:37,980 --> 00:30:38,380
Yan Shang.

401
00:30:40,380 --> 00:30:41,340
I know you're defending the city.

402
00:30:41,660 --> 00:30:42,380
I didn't want to bother you.

403
00:30:42,780 --> 00:30:45,020
But those rebels are out of their minds.

404
00:30:45,420 --> 00:30:46,420
They've even set fire to people's homes.

405
00:30:46,780 --> 00:30:47,500
I may be useless,

406
00:30:47,980 --> 00:30:48,860
but I want to do my part.

407
00:30:49,620 --> 00:30:50,300
What do you have in mind?

408
00:30:50,860 --> 00:30:52,380
I haven't left my alchemy room
in two years.

409
00:30:52,740 --> 00:30:54,500
I've figured out the secrets
of saltpeter and sulfur.

410
00:30:54,780 --> 00:30:55,540
If you give the order,

411
00:30:55,940 --> 00:30:57,300
I can start making

412
00:30:57,580 --> 00:30:58,220
gunpowder today.

413
00:30:58,580 --> 00:30:59,180
Gunpowder?

414
00:31:00,340 --> 00:31:00,980
Like firecrackers.

415
00:31:01,420 --> 00:31:02,220
With adjustments to the formula,

416
00:31:02,420 --> 00:31:03,500
it could be dozens of times
more powerful.

417
00:31:04,460 --> 00:31:06,300
I thought it might help.

418
00:31:06,980 --> 00:31:07,620
Excellent.

419
00:31:07,900 --> 00:31:08,500
How long will it take?

420
00:31:09,060 --> 00:31:09,940
If all goes well,

421
00:31:10,260 --> 00:31:10,900
three days.

422
00:31:14,300 --> 00:31:14,980
I can make

423
00:31:15,260 --> 00:31:16,580
a small batch
in as little as one day and one night.

424
00:31:17,940 --> 00:31:18,700
And if things don't go well?

425
00:31:20,620 --> 00:31:21,420
Then

426
00:31:22,060 --> 00:31:23,100
the alchemy room
in the Princess's Residence

427
00:31:23,340 --> 00:31:24,820
will be blown to ashes along with me.

428
00:31:29,340 --> 00:31:30,180
What materials do you need?

429
00:31:30,500 --> 00:31:31,620
I'll have them requisitioned at once.

430
00:31:32,100 --> 00:31:33,100
Just go ahead and do it.

431
00:31:39,340 --> 00:31:39,740
Yan Shang.

432
00:31:41,180 --> 00:31:42,140
Why isn't the Princess here?

433
00:31:42,500 --> 00:31:43,100
Where is she?

434
00:31:49,300 --> 00:31:50,180
She'll be back.

435
00:31:55,540 --> 00:31:58,900
(Border of the Central Circuit,
North Jing)

436
00:32:02,740 --> 00:32:07,580
(Border of the Central Circuit,
North Jing)

437
00:32:12,740 --> 00:32:13,780
Two and a half jin of saltpeter.

438
00:32:14,460 --> 00:32:15,260
One liang of hemp fiber.

439
00:32:15,900 --> 00:32:16,620
One liang of dry lacquer.

440
00:32:17,260 --> 00:32:18,180
And one liang of arsenic.

441
00:32:18,300 --> 00:32:18,860
I've weighed them all.

442
00:32:23,020 --> 00:32:23,620
Miss Zhao.

443
00:32:24,420 --> 00:32:25,180
It's too dangerous in here.

444
00:32:25,820 --> 00:32:26,620
Maybe you should...

445
00:32:26,740 --> 00:32:27,500
Cut it out.

446
00:32:27,660 --> 00:32:28,260
What else do I need to do?

447
00:32:29,980 --> 00:32:31,100
We need a lot of clay jars,

448
00:32:31,460 --> 00:32:33,260
oil cloth, paste, and fuses.

449
00:32:33,700 --> 00:32:35,140
Pack the jars with gunpowder,

450
00:32:35,500 --> 00:32:36,620
broken tiles, and iron nails.

451
00:32:37,060 --> 00:32:37,860
Seal them with tung oil.

452
00:32:38,300 --> 00:32:39,300
Then insert the powder fuse.

453
00:32:40,220 --> 00:32:40,620
I'll go get them.

454
00:32:42,700 --> 00:32:43,380
What's a powder fuse?

455
00:32:45,060 --> 00:32:46,740
A thin cord made by rolling paper
soaked in powder.

456
00:32:47,020 --> 00:32:47,940
It's used to ignite the gunpowder.

457
00:32:49,260 --> 00:32:50,060
Where can we get that?

458
00:32:50,860 --> 00:32:52,060
How thick should the paper cord be?

459
00:32:52,420 --> 00:32:53,100
I can make it.

460
00:32:53,300 --> 00:32:54,820
Yes, we can all make it.

461
00:32:54,820 --> 00:32:55,300
Don't come in.

462
00:32:55,900 --> 00:32:57,460
This room is full of gunpowder.
Too dangerous.

463
00:32:57,860 --> 00:32:58,780
Look at the situation we're in.

464
00:32:59,100 --> 00:33:01,460
Just tell us
what the fuse should look like.

465
00:33:02,300 --> 00:33:07,660
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

466
00:33:09,220 --> 00:33:14,860
♪Let the storms sweep the hills bare;
still, I cling to dreams of home♪

467
00:33:14,900 --> 00:33:18,660
♪If one day my homeland calls,
my heart stays true♪

468
00:33:18,660 --> 00:33:20,740
Your Highness, all the troops
you requested have been assembled

469
00:33:21,020 --> 00:33:22,020
and are waiting at the border.

470
00:33:24,380 --> 00:33:24,940
Thank you, General.

471
00:33:24,940 --> 00:33:28,220
♪Whose eyes have seen
the smoke of war?♪

472
00:33:28,260 --> 00:33:29,860
In the three years of your reign,

473
00:33:30,340 --> 00:33:31,620
you've shown North Jing great care.

474
00:33:32,380 --> 00:33:34,020
We are all grateful.

475
00:33:34,540 --> 00:33:35,260
When you give an order,

476
00:33:35,700 --> 00:33:36,620
we obey.

477
00:33:36,620 --> 00:33:40,100
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

478
00:33:40,100 --> 00:33:40,820
North Jing is in my hands.

479
00:33:41,260 --> 00:33:42,220
You all go with Her Highness.

480
00:33:42,940 --> 00:33:43,260
Yes.

481
00:33:43,460 --> 00:33:43,740
Yes.

482
00:33:43,740 --> 00:33:49,220
♪May the moon shine on us forever♪
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

483
00:33:49,220 --> 00:33:49,860
(Meng Zaishi,)

484
00:33:51,020 --> 00:33:51,460
(rest assured.)

485
00:33:53,220 --> 00:33:54,500
(I'll bring your troops back.)

486
00:34:14,100 --> 00:34:15,580
Tierong, give me a squad of cavalry.

487
00:34:15,940 --> 00:34:16,740
I'll ride ahead

488
00:34:17,180 --> 00:34:18,500
and get half a day's lead on you.

489
00:34:19,020 --> 00:34:20,220
You lead the main force on.

490
00:34:20,420 --> 00:34:20,700
Alright.

491
00:34:21,300 --> 00:34:21,780
I'll force-march

492
00:34:21,780 --> 00:34:23,300
along the route you've planned.

493
00:34:24,300 --> 00:34:25,420
Gu Han, come with me!

494
00:34:28,220 --> 00:34:33,180
♪Someday, we'll sail and feed the gulls♪

495
00:34:33,380 --> 00:34:35,820
♪Gaze upon the land
and guard it with you♪

496
00:34:35,820 --> 00:34:36,500
Who goes there?

497
00:34:37,780 --> 00:34:39,380
The garrison of Qinzhou
is here to receive you!

498
00:34:39,620 --> 00:34:40,460
We're joining the relief of Sheng'an!

499
00:34:42,020 --> 00:34:44,060
The Princess Regent ordered us
to prepare provisions,

500
00:34:44,260 --> 00:34:45,020
ready our troops,

501
00:34:45,260 --> 00:34:46,140
and join forces with you!

502
00:34:46,300 --> 00:34:46,740
Thank you.

503
00:34:46,740 --> 00:34:51,300
♪I'd trade all the world's romance
for one moment of tenderness♪

504
00:34:51,300 --> 00:34:52,580
(The Princess Regent is here!)

505
00:34:52,980 --> 00:34:54,580
(Pei Yun, Prefect of Tongzhou,
receive the order!)

506
00:34:54,900 --> 00:34:56,580
(Du Tong, Military Commander
of Zhangzhou, receive the order!)

507
00:34:56,900 --> 00:34:58,620
(Fang Yuan, Prefect of Yuzhou,
receive the order!)

508
00:34:58,980 --> 00:35:00,020
(By order of the Princess Regent,)

509
00:35:00,300 --> 00:35:02,140
(garrisons in prefectures along the way,
armor up and form ranks!)

510
00:35:02,380 --> 00:35:03,180
(Travel light!)

511
00:35:03,300 --> 00:35:04,740
(Rush to Sheng'an's aid!)

512
00:35:04,740 --> 00:35:06,620
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

513
00:35:07,260 --> 00:35:11,460
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

514
00:35:11,700 --> 00:35:18,340
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
may the moon shine on us forever♪

515
00:35:20,940 --> 00:35:22,180
People of Sheng'an, hear me!

516
00:35:22,980 --> 00:35:24,460
I am Huai's rightful heir.

517
00:35:24,740 --> 00:35:26,180
I can't bear to see my people suffer!

518
00:35:26,980 --> 00:35:27,460
Today,

519
00:35:27,940 --> 00:35:28,780
whoever opens the city gates

520
00:35:29,820 --> 00:35:30,860
will receive a thousand taels of gold.

521
00:35:32,300 --> 00:35:33,660
Whoever captures the impostor Yan Shang

522
00:35:34,820 --> 00:35:35,860
will be made a marquis.

523
00:35:36,380 --> 00:35:38,420
Anyone who joins me
will be forgiven for past crimes.

524
00:35:38,700 --> 00:35:39,380
Those who resist

525
00:35:40,060 --> 00:35:41,140
will be slain on sight!

526
00:35:41,660 --> 00:35:42,380
Pah!

527
00:35:42,980 --> 00:35:43,900
Rightful heir, my foot!

528
00:35:44,460 --> 00:35:45,620
You wretch!

529
00:35:46,540 --> 00:35:47,300
Exactly!

530
00:35:47,740 --> 00:35:48,620
With the war raging,

531
00:35:48,900 --> 00:35:50,500
we can still buy rice and medicine
in the city.

532
00:35:50,700 --> 00:35:51,820
Things haven't fallen apart.

533
00:35:52,100 --> 00:35:53,540
All thanks to Scholar Yan!

534
00:35:56,300 --> 00:35:57,020
(Guanghua Gate)
Are you done?

535
00:35:59,260 --> 00:36:00,620
If so, it's my turn.

536
00:36:03,220 --> 00:36:05,340
I am Yan Shang,
Commandant of the Guards.

537
00:36:06,580 --> 00:36:07,780
Hear me, soldiers,

538
00:36:08,660 --> 00:36:09,700
both rebel and loyal!

539
00:36:11,380 --> 00:36:12,700
You all come from good families.

540
00:36:13,740 --> 00:36:14,700
The people inside

541
00:36:15,580 --> 00:36:17,100
and outside this city
are all Huai's subjects.

542
00:36:19,060 --> 00:36:20,140
Whomever your weapons strike,

543
00:36:21,700 --> 00:36:23,260
they are your own kin and neighbors.

544
00:36:25,340 --> 00:36:25,940
You have been

545
00:36:26,900 --> 00:36:28,580
misled by the traitor Mu Xun.

546
00:36:29,980 --> 00:36:31,180
This is not what you truly want!

547
00:36:32,340 --> 00:36:32,700
Now

548
00:36:33,740 --> 00:36:34,700
Sheng'an lies in ruins...

549
00:36:35,500 --> 00:36:36,380
What are you waiting for?

550
00:36:37,260 --> 00:36:37,620
Are you

551
00:36:37,980 --> 00:36:39,580
going to let him keep poisoning
people's minds?

552
00:36:40,300 --> 00:36:42,660
Anyone who lays down their arms
and surrenders now

553
00:36:43,900 --> 00:36:44,940
will be pardoned

554
00:36:45,460 --> 00:36:46,740
and may return home!

555
00:36:47,380 --> 00:36:48,620
The harvest is near.

556
00:36:50,060 --> 00:36:51,460
Your wives and children
are waiting for you!

557
00:36:51,460 --> 00:36:51,860
Shoot him!

558
00:36:53,140 --> 00:36:54,860
(Guanghua Gate)

559
00:37:17,220 --> 00:37:18,700
Would you rather die on foreign soil

560
00:37:20,260 --> 00:37:21,740
or return home?

561
00:37:23,780 --> 00:37:25,380
Proclaim it throughout the camps

562
00:37:27,660 --> 00:37:29,740
and let all hear!

563
00:37:33,380 --> 00:37:33,900
My life

564
00:37:34,620 --> 00:37:35,660
is of no consequence.

565
00:37:36,620 --> 00:37:37,900
Do not worry about me.

566
00:37:37,900 --> 00:37:39,260
(Guanghua Gate)

567
00:37:45,140 --> 00:37:45,780
Your priority

568
00:37:46,980 --> 00:37:48,340
is to defend the city.

569
00:38:05,220 --> 00:38:07,140
- Commander Yan!
- Commander Yan!

570
00:38:07,140 --> 00:38:08,020
Call the imperial physician!

571
00:38:08,380 --> 00:38:08,860
Commander Yan!

572
00:38:08,980 --> 00:38:09,420
Commander Yan!

573
00:38:10,740 --> 00:38:12,740
Commander Yan says
as long as we stand, the city stands!

574
00:38:13,060 --> 00:38:14,500
As long as we stand together,

575
00:38:14,700 --> 00:38:16,500
Sheng'an will never fall!

576
00:38:16,500 --> 00:38:18,620
With Commander Yan here,
we have nothing to fear!

577
00:38:18,860 --> 00:38:20,900
Commander Yan, you've suffered so much!

578
00:38:22,220 --> 00:38:23,580
The rebel Yan Shang is dead!

579
00:38:27,860 --> 00:38:28,580
Attack!

580
00:38:30,940 --> 00:38:33,500
(Guanghua Gate)

581
00:38:36,300 --> 00:38:37,380
(Guanghua Gate)

582
00:38:37,380 --> 00:38:38,220
Set the ladders!

583
00:38:38,980 --> 00:38:40,380
Hold them steady! Climb!

584
00:38:50,980 --> 00:38:51,540
Hold them off.

585
00:38:51,940 --> 00:38:52,660
Don't let them in!

586
00:38:55,100 --> 00:38:55,620
Someone!

587
00:38:55,900 --> 00:38:56,700
Someone!

588
00:38:59,300 --> 00:38:59,540
Hurry!

589
00:39:03,180 --> 00:39:03,460
Quick!

590
00:39:09,900 --> 00:39:12,860
(Guanghua Gate)

591
00:39:28,740 --> 00:39:29,220
It worked.

592
00:39:29,940 --> 00:39:30,660
You did it!

593
00:39:31,180 --> 00:39:32,140
We did it.

594
00:39:33,420 --> 00:39:35,780
Everyone, keep lighting them!

595
00:39:55,140 --> 00:39:55,500
Commander Yan.

596
00:39:56,140 --> 00:39:56,660
Bring it here. Hurry.

597
00:39:59,500 --> 00:39:59,820
Quick.

598
00:40:05,300 --> 00:40:05,700
Commander Yan.

599
00:40:06,380 --> 00:40:06,660
Hurry!

600
00:40:11,940 --> 00:40:12,460
Here, the medicine.

601
00:40:12,900 --> 00:40:13,100
Here.

602
00:40:21,380 --> 00:40:22,500
We owe it all to Commander Yan.

603
00:40:22,500 --> 00:40:25,300
Now rumors are spreading
and morale's in chaos.

604
00:40:25,860 --> 00:40:27,260
We need to do something.

605
00:40:27,660 --> 00:40:29,460
They claim that Yan Shang died
and his head has been sent to the army.

606
00:40:29,740 --> 00:40:30,620
That's utter nonsense!

607
00:40:32,220 --> 00:40:32,820
But now...

608
00:40:34,060 --> 00:40:35,140
Commander Yan looks...

609
00:40:39,260 --> 00:40:40,460
Imperial Physician, how is he?

610
00:40:40,980 --> 00:40:43,540
The arrow pierced Commander Yan's lung.

611
00:40:43,660 --> 00:40:45,860
He's lost a lot of blood,
and the fever hasn't broken.

612
00:40:46,980 --> 00:40:47,740
His life

613
00:40:48,340 --> 00:40:50,660
is hanging by a thread.

614
00:40:51,500 --> 00:40:54,580
All we can do now is
try everything to stop the bleeding.

615
00:40:59,020 --> 00:41:00,180
Blood! Blood!

616
00:41:00,700 --> 00:41:01,900
The bleeding won't stop!

617
00:41:03,060 --> 00:41:03,660
Stop the bleeding!

618
00:41:04,260 --> 00:41:04,820
Someone!

619
00:41:05,580 --> 00:41:06,780
Help stop the bleeding! Quick!

620
00:41:07,060 --> 00:41:09,420
The bleeding won't stop!

621
00:41:09,660 --> 00:41:11,020
Someone, help!

622
00:41:11,500 --> 00:41:12,380
The bleeding won't stop!

623
00:41:12,620 --> 00:41:12,980
Your Royal Highness,

624
00:41:13,540 --> 00:41:15,020
Yan Shang's words
have spread everywhere.

625
00:41:15,420 --> 00:41:17,060
The people of Sheng'an are defending
the city with soaring morale.

626
00:41:17,340 --> 00:41:18,340
Our troops are losing heart.

627
00:41:18,620 --> 00:41:19,420
If we keep attacking,

628
00:41:20,100 --> 00:41:21,260
I'm afraid we'll suffer heavy losses.

629
00:41:21,580 --> 00:41:22,820
We've come this far.

630
00:41:23,940 --> 00:41:25,780
Who cares about losses now?

631
00:41:26,140 --> 00:41:27,420
Once I take Sheng'an,

632
00:41:28,820 --> 00:41:29,860
every one of you

633
00:41:31,020 --> 00:41:32,660
will be honored!

634
00:41:37,060 --> 00:41:37,500
Follow me

635
00:41:39,020 --> 00:41:40,380
and keep attacking tomorrow.

636
00:41:41,540 --> 00:41:43,180
No one is to undermine
the troops' morale.

637
00:41:44,300 --> 00:41:44,740
Your Royal Highness,

638
00:41:45,420 --> 00:41:46,860
forcing soldiers
to throw their lives away

639
00:41:47,220 --> 00:41:47,700
may

640
00:41:48,300 --> 00:41:49,140
destroy our morale.

641
00:41:49,140 --> 00:41:49,620
Yang Si!

642
00:42:00,100 --> 00:42:00,900
They're under siege.

643
00:42:01,460 --> 00:42:03,020
Their arrows and provisions are limited.

644
00:42:03,700 --> 00:42:05,740
How much saltpeter and sulfur
could they possibly have?

645
00:42:06,260 --> 00:42:07,460
I'd like to see

646
00:42:08,140 --> 00:42:09,180
how long

647
00:42:10,380 --> 00:42:11,940
their bombs can last.

648
00:42:22,300 --> 00:42:24,260
Sir, word from Sheng'an...

649
00:42:24,540 --> 00:42:26,380
How dare you disrupt
the imperial audience!

650
00:42:28,020 --> 00:42:28,700
Your Majesty,

651
00:42:29,020 --> 00:42:30,220
word from Sheng'an

652
00:42:30,460 --> 00:42:32,220
is that the defender, Scholar Yan,
has been killed in battle.

653
00:42:32,500 --> 00:42:33,780
Sheng'an has fallen?

654
00:42:34,100 --> 00:42:35,260
When the messenger left,

655
00:42:35,460 --> 00:42:37,100
the city was on the verge of falling.

656
00:42:37,380 --> 00:42:37,780
We

657
00:42:38,420 --> 00:42:39,260
don't know its fate now.

658
00:42:39,700 --> 00:42:40,260
This is bad.

659
00:42:42,140 --> 00:42:43,940
If Mu Xun takes Sheng'an...

660
00:42:44,180 --> 00:42:45,180
(Cui Quan, Prefect of Jinzhou)

661
00:42:45,180 --> 00:42:46,060
Don't panic, Your Majesty.

662
00:42:46,500 --> 00:42:47,820
Jinzhou is far from Sheng'an.

663
00:42:48,060 --> 00:42:48,900
They won't reach us

664
00:42:49,140 --> 00:42:50,300
anytime soon.

665
00:42:51,020 --> 00:42:52,820
That's not far at all!

666
00:42:55,780 --> 00:42:57,700
Mu Xun is ruthless.

667
00:42:58,300 --> 00:42:59,940
Once he secures Sheng'an,

668
00:43:01,020 --> 00:43:02,540
he'll come straight for us.

669
00:43:03,460 --> 00:43:03,860
I have to leave.

670
00:43:05,260 --> 00:43:05,580
I have to go.

671
00:43:07,060 --> 00:43:08,260
I must leave at once!

672
00:43:09,420 --> 00:43:10,060
I'm heading south!

673
00:43:10,300 --> 00:43:10,860
Your Majesty!

674
00:43:11,220 --> 00:43:11,580
Your Majesty...

675
00:43:11,660 --> 00:43:12,020
Your Majesty.

676
00:43:12,180 --> 00:43:12,860
No way.

677
00:43:12,860 --> 00:43:13,420
You mustn't!

678
00:43:13,420 --> 00:43:14,540
No way they can cross the Yangtze River.

679
00:43:14,540 --> 00:43:16,700
Your Majesty, you can't go alone.

680
00:43:16,900 --> 00:43:18,860
I'll accompany you south!

681
00:43:18,860 --> 00:43:20,140
Your Majesty!

682
00:43:20,780 --> 00:43:21,380
Slow down.

683
00:43:21,540 --> 00:43:22,140
Keep up! Hurry!

684
00:43:34,100 --> 00:43:34,580
Come on.

685
00:43:35,140 --> 00:43:37,340
I've come up with a good solution.

686
00:43:38,380 --> 00:43:39,060
If...

687
00:43:39,860 --> 00:43:42,140
If Mu Xun catches up with me...

688
00:43:43,460 --> 00:43:45,780
Chancellor Liu and Yan Shang
are both dead anyway.

689
00:43:46,980 --> 00:43:47,740
I'll just say

690
00:43:48,300 --> 00:43:49,700
it was Mu Wanyao!

691
00:43:50,460 --> 00:43:51,940
She's the real usurper!

692
00:43:54,900 --> 00:43:55,780
Yan Shang is dead?

693
00:44:00,060 --> 00:44:04,820
(Next Episode Preview)

694
00:44:05,340 --> 00:44:08,140
I'll order
the Noble Consort's execution.

695
00:44:08,580 --> 00:44:11,420
How thoughtful of you now.

696
00:44:16,260 --> 00:44:16,660
No!

697
00:44:22,761 --> 00:44:26,054
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

698
00:44:28,739 --> 00:44:33,655
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

699
00:44:35,849 --> 00:44:41,694
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

700
00:44:42,194 --> 00:44:47,420
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

701
00:44:50,189 --> 00:44:54,980
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

702
00:44:55,816 --> 00:45:01,895
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

703
00:45:03,696 --> 00:45:06,846
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

704
00:45:06,846 --> 00:45:08,494
♪Burning bright as a song♪

705
00:45:08,546 --> 00:45:12,270
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

706
00:45:12,648 --> 00:45:17,314
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

707
00:45:17,933 --> 00:45:21,974
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

708
00:45:22,465 --> 00:45:24,580
♪Not a single hour less♪

709
00:45:24,620 --> 00:45:31,566
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

710
00:45:32,329 --> 00:45:35,782
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

711
00:45:35,962 --> 00:45:39,107
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

712
00:45:39,546 --> 00:45:46,183
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

713
00:45:46,580 --> 00:45:48,618
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

714
00:45:48,618 --> 00:45:51,094
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

715
00:45:51,132 --> 00:45:53,601
♪You're the only one I need♪

716
00:45:53,805 --> 00:46:00,692
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

717
00:46:01,004 --> 00:46:04,275
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

718
00:46:04,580 --> 00:46:07,753
♪My last untouched innocence♪

719
00:46:08,077 --> 00:46:11,503
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

720
00:46:11,736 --> 00:46:14,961
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

721
00:46:15,292 --> 00:46:22,088
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

722
00:46:22,457 --> 00:46:24,519
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

723
00:46:24,520 --> 00:46:27,023
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

724
00:46:27,070 --> 00:46:29,408
♪You're the only one I need♪

725
00:46:29,639 --> 00:46:36,474
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

726
00:46:36,823 --> 00:46:38,441
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

727
00:46:38,571 --> 00:46:40,367
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

728
00:46:40,724 --> 00:46:43,741
♪You're the only one I need♪

729
00:46:43,781 --> 00:46:45,108
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

